<title>UK: Britain clears GUS buy of Experian.</title>
<headline>Britain clears GUS buy of Experian.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Department of Trade and Industry on Friday cleared the acquisition of U.S. group Experian by retailer Great Universal Stores Plc.</p>
<p>The DTI said it would not refer the estimated $1.7 billion acquisition of the U.S. credit services company to Britain's Monopolies and Mergers Commission.</p>
<p>GUS shares were up 8.5p at 633 by 1110 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
